15:56.540 --> 15:57.300
I somehow

347
15:57.300 --> 15:58.370
thought of you.

348
15:58.370 --> 15:59.100
I'm telling the truth.

349
15:59.100 --> 16:00.060
I apologize!

350
16:00.060 --> 16:00.650
Okay?

351
16:00.650 --> 16:01.340
Xiaoyun?

352
16:02.370 --> 16:03.100
How about this?

353
16:03.100 --> 16:05.360
I'll slap myself!

354
16:05.490 --> 16:06.940
I'm sorry, okay?

355
16:09.970 --> 16:10.970
Did you hear that?

356
16:16.210 --> 16:20.040
[1 week later]

357
16:18.610 --> 16:20.040
Given that Wugang Petrochemical

358
16:20.040 --> 16:21.280
[713 Project Phase 2 Bidding Conference]

359
16:20.100 --> 16:21.490
has financial issues

360
16:21.690 --> 16:23.020
pending verification,

361
16:23.300 --> 16:26.370
and that the project cycle cannot be delayed,

362
16:27.220 --> 16:29.020
after discussion by the judges,

363
16:29.420 --> 16:30.990
the winning bidder for

364
16:31.020 --> 16:33.500
713 Project Phase 2 is

365
16:33.970 --> 16:36.490
Fuwenshan Pipeline Engineering Technology

366
16:36.490 --> 16:38.160
Co., Ltd.

367
16:44.990 --> 16:46.300
[713 Project Phase 2 Bidding Conference]

368
16:57.050 --> 17:00.620
[Sun Jie] [Chen Shan] [Geng Jian]

369
17:03.100 --> 17:04.099
About the design, we...

370
17:04.099 --> 17:04.849
Mr. Chen.

371
17:05.410 --> 17:06.300
Qi Mo is here

372
17:06.300 --> 17:07.430
and wants to see you.

373
17:07.650 --> 17:08.300
I told him to come in,

374
17:08.300 --> 17:09.020
but he wouldn't.

375
17:09.020 --> 17:10.130
He's at the door.

376
17:10.780 --> 17:12.040
-Qi Mo is here? -It's really Qi Mo?

377
17:12.040 --> 17:12.970
I'll take a look.

378
17:20.770 --> 17:22.180
Wait, why is he here?

379
17:22.220 --> 17:24.099
What does he mean?

380
17:24.410 --> 17:25.260
I-It's fine.

381
17:25.260 --> 17:26.819
I'll talk to him myself.

382
17:26.819 --> 17:27.369
Okay.

383
17:29.450 --> 17:30.210
Mo.

384
17:30.690 --> 17:32.890
Why don't you come in?

385
17:33.250 --> 17:34.210
Why stand here?

386
17:34.450 --> 17:35.500
No, thanks.

387
17:36.210 --> 17:38.740
There are too many people.

388
17:38.740 --> 17:39.940
Let's just talk here.

389
17:43.210 --> 17:45.410
You used a nasty trick

390
17:45.890 --> 17:46.850
this time.

391
17:47.790 --> 17:48.450
But I'm not here

392
17:48.450 --> 17:49.650
to ask

393
17:49.850 --> 17:51.890
who gave you the accounts.

394
17:52.020 --> 17:53.100
A win is a win.

395
17:53.200 --> 17:54.260
I accept it.

396
17:55.890 --> 17:56.850
But Shan,

397
17:56.930 --> 17:59.500
don't think that winning the bid

398
17:59.500 --> 18:01.020
means everything is fine.

399
18:01.420 --> 18:02.760
Project 713 Phase 2

400
18:02.790 --> 18:04.140
is a very tough

401
18:04.160 --> 18:05.000
nut to crack.

402
18:05.000 --> 18:06.110
Our company

403
18:06.480 --> 18:07.890
is large and well-established.

404
18:07.890 --> 18:09.560
Even with financial issues,

405
18:09.590 --> 18:11.510
investors are still willing to lend us money.

406
18:11.510 --> 18:12.310
But you...

407
18:13.590 --> 18:15.000
Who would lend money to

408
18:15.070 --> 18:16.920
a small company like yours?

409
18:17.590 --> 18:18.920
This is my own business.

410
18:19.470 --> 18:20.990
Don't worry about it, Mo.

411
18:23.070 --> 18:23.880
Fine.

412
18:24.440 --> 18:26.510
Even if you can get a loan,

413
18:27.590 --> 18:29.920
if the phase-one project fails the inspection,

414
18:29.920 --> 18:31.790
you still won't get the money.

415
18:32.150 --> 18:33.520
You might even end up

416
18:33.640 --> 18:35.440
in debt for the rest of your life.

417
18:37.720 --> 18:38.720
I have a

418
18:39.310 --> 18:41.350
win-win solution.

419
18:41.680 --> 18:46.660
Sell the design and copyright

420
18:46.880 --> 18:47.680
to me

421
18:47.790 --> 18:49.520
and withdraw from the bidding.

422
18:49.920 --> 18:51.510
I'll give you 3 million yuan.

423
18:51.510 --> 18:53.160
You can make money

424
18:53.160 --> 18:54.620
while avoiding the risks.

425
18:54.640 --> 18:55.720
Why not?

426
18:55.880 --> 18:56.830
3 million?

427
19:00.160 --> 19:00.920
Yes.

428
19:01.270 --> 19:03.890
The risks you just mentioned

429
19:03.980 --> 19:05.200
do exist.

430
19:06.400 --> 19:07.400
But look,

431
19:08.240 --> 19:10.620
both starting a company and bidding

432
19:10.680 --> 19:12.110
have risks.

433
19:12.590 --> 19:14.260
But I've managed

434
19:14.400 --> 19:15.310
to get

435
19:15.440 --> 19:16.640
them done.

436
19:17.920 --> 19:19.160
So, I'm not worried about

437
19:19.160 --> 19:20.440
these risks.

438
19:20.750 --> 19:21.870
Most importantly,

439
19:22.110 --> 19:23.350
who knows

440
19:24.110 --> 19:25.920
what will happen in the future?

441
19:26.750 --> 19:27.550
Right?

442
19:33.880 --> 19:34.740
How about this?

443
19:36.270 --> 19:38.510
The public notice period still has 15 days left.

444
19:38.510 --> 19:39.790
Think it through.

445
19:40.400 --> 19:41.330
There's no rush.

446
19:41.920 --> 19:43.250
If you change your mind,

447
19:43.680 --> 19:44.810
contact me anytime.

448
19:45.440 --> 19:46.240
Okay.

449
19:47.640 --> 19:49.350
Well, let me walk you out.

450
19:49.350 --> 19:50.240
No need.

451
19:50.350 --> 19:51.750
Just stay here.

452
19:53.480 --> 19:54.510
Take care, Mo.

453
20:05.920 --> 20:07.000
I have to say, Feng,

454
20:07.030 --> 20:09.000
your design is amazing.

455
20:09.510 --> 20:10.820
Why did Qi Mo

456
20:11.070 --> 20:12.310
come here?

457
20:12.920 --> 20:14.230
Qi Mo just said

458
20:14.750 --> 20:16.510
he wanted to spend 3 million yuan

459
20:16.510 --> 20:17.920
to buy our design

460
20:18.200 --> 20:19.790
and have us withdraw from the bidding.

461
20:19.790 --> 20:20.750
Is he crazy?

462
20:20.750 --> 20:22.480
Exactly. How's that possible?

463
20:22.480 --> 20:23.200
Exactly.

464
20:23.200 --> 20:24.170
So shameless.

465
20:24.510 --> 20:25.880
That's something he'd do.

466
20:25.880 --> 20:26.480
Yes.

467
20:26.480 --> 20:27.200
It's fine.

468
20:27.350 --> 20:28.350
Anyway, this also shows

469
20:28.350 --> 20:30.030
that our design

470
20:30.030 --> 20:31.430
has impressed everyone.

471
20:32.400 --> 20:33.480
Let's eat something first.

472
20:33.480 --> 20:34.830
Then we'll keep working.

473
20:34.830 --> 20:35.720
Okay, let's go.

474
20:35.720 --> 20:36.350
Let's eat.

475
20:36.350 --> 20:36.790
Let's eat.

476
20:36.790 --> 20:37.750
Jie, come here for a second.

477
20:37.750 --> 20:38.400
Okay.

478
20:43.830 --> 20:45.350
Give Liu Jun a call

479
20:45.440 --> 20:46.440
and let him know.

480
20:46.680 --> 20:47.480
Say what?

481
20:48.720 --> 20:51.110
Tell him that Qi Mo wants to spend 3 million yuan

482
20:51.110 --> 20:52.830
to buy the design.

483
20:53.180 --> 20:54.030
Got it.

484
21:05.790 --> 21:06.590
You...

485
21:06.880 --> 21:08.510
Why did you come here?

486
21:09.110 --> 21:09.920
500,000 yuan.

487
21:10.240 --> 21:11.030
What 500,000 yuan?

488
21:11.030 --> 21:12.350
Where do you expect me to get it?

489
21:12.350 --> 21:13.270
I can't even get 50,000 yuan.

490
21:13.270 --> 21:15.200
Where am I supposed to get 500,000?

491
21:15.200 --> 21:16.350
Are you playing me?

492
21:16.880 --> 21:18.350
My patience has run out.

493
21:18.680 --> 21:19.240
No.

494
21:19.240 --> 21:20.350
You don't have any patience.

495
21:20.350 --> 21:21.000
I just...

496
21:21.000 --> 21:21.960
I don't have 500,000 yuan.

497
21:21.960 --> 21:23.070
Where am I supposed to get 500,000?

498
21:23.070 --> 21:23.550
Your company

499
21:23.550 --> 21:24.920
just won the bid.

500
21:25.000 --> 21:26.350
And someone is willing to pay 3 million yuan

501
21:26.350 --> 21:27.200
for your proposal.

502
21:27.200 --> 21:29.000
Who'd believe you have no money?

503
21:29.680 --> 21:30.510
Who told you that?

504
21:30.510 --> 21:31.630
None of your business!

505
21:31.630 --> 21:32.830
-Lower your voice. -I'm not asking for more.

506
21:32.830 --> 21:33.880
I only want 500,000 yuan.

507
21:33.880 --> 21:35.400
Liu Hong, listen to me.

508
21:35.400 --> 21:36.800
I'll explain about that 3 million yuan.

509
21:36.800 --> 21:37.560
It's because

510
21:37.560 --> 21:39.050
they want to buy it,

511
21:39.050 --> 21:39.490
but they haven't.

512
21:39.490 --> 21:41.080
Even if it's sold,

513
21:41.080 --> 21:41.760
the company will get the money.

514
21:41.760 --> 21:42.690
I won't.

515
21:42.690 --> 21:44.210
My godson Chen Shan

516
21:44.210 --> 21:45.210
will get it.

517
21:45.210 --> 21:46.330
I'm trying to find a way.

518
21:46.330 --> 21:47.460
Where are you going?

519
21:47.770 --> 21:49.120
Where are you going?

520
21:49.120 --> 21:50.050
Where are you going?

521
21:50.050 --> 21:50.880
I'll talk to Chen Shan!

522
21:50.880 --> 21:52.560
C-Come back!

523
21:53.190 --> 21:53.990
Come here.

524
21:54.400 --> 21:55.010
Come here.

525
21:55.010 --> 21:56.290
Listen to me.

526
21:56.290 --> 21:57.050
Listen to me, Liu Hong.

527
21:57.050 --> 21:58.160
I'm begging you.

528
21:58.160 --> 21:59.120
You won't give it to me,

529
21:59.120 --> 22:00.080
so I'll go ask Chen Shan for it.

530
22:00.080 --> 22:00.880
I'll give it to you!

531
22:00.880 --> 22:02.210
I'll give it to you!

532
22:02.210 --> 22:03.010
Look,

533
22:03.290 --> 22:04.290
c-can you give me

534
22:04.290 --> 22:05.450
24 hours?

535
22:05.930 --> 22:06.970
If I don't

536
22:07.400 --> 22:08.360
give you the money,

537
22:08.360 --> 22:09.530
you can do whatever you want.

538
22:09.530 --> 22:10.770
You can sue me.

539
22:12.640 --> 22:13.450
Geng Jian,

540
22:15.210 --> 22:16.810
I'll trust you one last time.

541
22:17.210 --> 22:18.010
Okay.

542
22:21.730 --> 22:22.530
Your mask!

543
22:24.970 --> 22:27.650
[Wanjin Pawn Shop]

544
22:27.400 --> 22:29.560
I painted this.

545
22:31.080 --> 22:32.360
Are you kidding me?

546
22:32.930 --> 22:33.800
You painted this?

547
22:33.800 --> 22:36.250
This is Zhao Hui's painting.

548
22:36.250 --> 22:38.010
You don't know.

549
22:38.250 --> 22:40.560
Zhao Hui's paintings have been very popular these years,

550
22:40.560 --> 22:42.560
so I copied

551
22:42.560 --> 22:43.560
a few

552
22:43.970 --> 22:45.050
to make some money.

553
22:48.730 --> 22:50.460
Are you saying this on purpose?

554
22:50.770 --> 22:51.840
You want this painting,

555
22:51.840 --> 22:52.800
so you're trying

556
22:52.800 --> 22:54.160
to bargain, right?

557
22:55.080 --> 22:56.160
Are you saying this on purpose?

558
22:56.160 --> 22:57.400
This is authentic!

559
22:57.640 --> 22:58.730
This is authentic!

560
22:58.730 --> 23:00.260
What do you mean authentic?

561
23:02.050 --> 23:02.970
You don't believe me?

562
23:02.970 --> 23:03.640
Come on.

563
23:04.290 --> 23:05.210
Look.

564
23:06.010 --> 23:08.360
It's exactly the same as yours.

565
23:06.870 --> 23:08.820
[Gathering of Fine Traits]

566
23:08.450 --> 23:09.250
By the way,

567
23:09.400 --> 23:11.600
a few years ago, someone from your plant

568
23:11.640 --> 23:12.800
came here

569
23:12.800 --> 23:13.770
and bought

570
23:13.770 --> 23:15.250
an identical one.

571
23:15.490 --> 23:17.320
I even sold for over 10,000 yuan.

572
23:18.690 --> 23:20.480
A refined work like this

573
23:20.640 --> 23:22.930
should belong to a capable person.

574
23:22.930 --> 23:23.490
Then it occurred to me

575
23:23.490 --> 23:25.210
the most capable person around me

576
23:25.210 --> 23:26.490
is you, right?

577
23:28.690 --> 23:31.770
Where did you get this painting?

578
23:51.840 --> 23:52.560
Come on.

579
23:52.560 --> 23:53.740
Come in.

580
23:56.770 --> 23:57.900
Come in, Manager Qi.

581
24:00.600 --> 24:02.060
Come into the living room.

582
24:08.490 --> 24:09.210
Have a seat. I'll...

583
24:09.210 --> 24:10.360
get you some water.

584
24:11.250 --> 24:12.910
When can you pay back the money

585
24:14.600 --> 24:15.730
you owe the company?

586
24:19.270 --> 24:19.890
Manager Qi,

587
24:19.890 --> 24:21.490
I-I won't

588
24:21.690 --> 24:23.080
default on my debt.

589
24:23.210 --> 24:23.840
How about this?

590
24:23.840 --> 24:25.300
Let me show you something.

591
24:25.690 --> 24:26.420
Well, this is

592
24:26.430 --> 24:28.250
a painting I kept at a friend's place.

593
24:28.250 --> 24:29.970
It's by Zhao Hui,

594
24:29.970 --> 24:31.050
the famous artist.

595
24:30.570 --> 24:30.980
[Gathering of Fine Traits]

596
24:31.080 --> 24:32.560
It's worth 500,000 yuan.

597
24:32.600 --> 24:33.250
Take a look.

598
24:33.250 --> 24:34.530
You can take it.

599
24:35.640 --> 24:37.170
I know about this painting.

600
24:37.560 --> 24:38.490
It's worthless.

601
24:38.560 --> 24:39.450
Just tell me,

602
24:39.690 --> 24:40.690
when will you transfer the money

603
24:40.690 --> 24:42.350
to the head office's account?

604
24:43.290 --> 24:43.690
Wait, you're the boss

605
24:43.690 --> 24:44.800
of a big company.

606
24:44.800 --> 24:47.130
Do you really need a few hundred thousand?

607
24:47.600 --> 24:48.210
What do you mean?

608
24:48.210 --> 24:49.930
Do I need a few hundred thousand?

609
24:49.930 --> 24:51.490
Don't you know if I lack money or not?

610
24:51.490 --> 24:52.120
It was you

611
24:52.120 --> 24:53.360
who secretly collected dirt on my loans

612
24:53.360 --> 24:54.120
and gave it to Chen Shan.

613
24:54.120 --> 24:54.730
Don't think I don't know

614
24:54.730 --> 24:55.800
that you did this!

615
24:55.800 --> 24:56.560
Listen, this isn't over!

616
24:56.560 --> 24:57.800
No, I don't even know where Chen Shan

617
24:57.800 --> 24:59.080
got those materials!

618
24:59.080 --> 24:59.770
I have no idea!

619
24:59.770 --> 25:00.760
Come on, stop lying.

620
25:00.760 --> 25:02.860
I don't know!

621
25:02.870 --> 25:03.870
You've been acting like this for many years.

622
25:03.870 --> 25:05.400
Can you try a different act?

623
25:05.870 --> 25:07.110
I really don't know!

624
25:08.870 --> 25:09.660
Geng Jian...

625
25:11.180 --> 25:11.980
Look,

626
25:12.980 --> 25:13.910
when you go back,

627
25:14.220 --> 25:15.370
ask Chen Shan for it.

628
25:15.870 --> 25:16.730
Tell Chen Shan

629
25:16.830 --> 25:18.150
to sell the design of the phase-two project

630
25:18.150 --> 25:18.910
to me

631
25:19.070 --> 25:20.180
and withdraw from the bidding.

632
25:20.180 --> 25:21.180
And I'll transfer

633
25:21.310 --> 25:22.180
3 million yuan to your account.

634
25:22.180 --> 25:23.420
As for the money you owe me,

635
25:23.420 --> 25:24.460
I can give you

636
25:24.550 --> 25:25.420
more time.

637
25:32.700 --> 25:33.700
Here, Godfather.

638
25:34.290 --> 25:35.490
Have some warm water.

639
25:40.260 --> 25:41.780
You came to see me this late

640
25:41.810 --> 25:43.660
just to make me sell the project

641
25:43.900 --> 25:45.380
to Qi Mo for 3 million yuan?

642
25:45.530 --> 25:46.330
Yes.

643
25:47.130 --> 25:47.850
Let me

644
25:47.870 --> 25:49.350
analyze this for you.

645
25:49.350 --> 25:50.080
Well,

646
25:50.080 --> 25:51.430
Project 713

647
25:51.430 --> 25:52.080
is indeed a great opportunity

648
25:52.080 --> 25:53.520
for us.

649
25:53.590 --> 25:55.760
But it has risks.

650
25:56.000 --> 25:57.560
If anything happens,

651
25:57.560 --> 25:59.320
all your efforts will be in vain.

652
25:59.320 --> 26:00.480
We're a startup,

653
26:00.480 --> 26:01.940
and we have a long way to go.

654
26:02.000 --> 26:04.240
With this 3 million yuan as a foundation,

655
26:04.240 --> 26:06.500
what project can't you get in the future?

656
26:09.190 --> 26:11.240
Do you think it's possible, Godfather?

657
26:11.240 --> 26:12.430
We finally got this chance

658
26:12.430 --> 26:13.510
to go head-to-head

659
26:13.540 --> 26:14.870
with Qi Mo.

660
26:15.240 --> 26:16.430
And we can finally

661
26:16.430 --> 26:17.670
avenge my father.

662
26:17.830 --> 26:18.590
If I sell

663
26:18.590 --> 26:19.800
this project now,

664
26:19.870 --> 26:21.800
our efforts will really be in vain.

665
26:23.320 --> 26:24.590
Think it through.

666
26:24.590 --> 26:25.590
Wait, Godfather.

667
26:25.830 --> 26:26.960
Just tell me.

668
26:27.800 --> 26:29.130
What exactly happened?

669
26:29.320 --> 26:30.320
Why did you suddenly ask me

670
26:30.320 --> 26:31.520
to sell this project?

671
26:33.480 --> 26:35.280
Qi Mo is forcing me to pay him back.

672
26:35.280 --> 26:36.000
What? He...

673
26:36.430 --> 26:37.670
When he accused you

674
26:37.670 --> 26:38.800
of embezzlement,

675
26:38.800 --> 26:39.800
I wanted to ask you.

676
26:39.800 --> 26:40.590
What did you do

677
26:40.590 --> 26:42.450
with that a few hundred thousand?

678
26:44.280 --> 26:45.140
Stock trading.

679
26:46.190 --> 26:47.520
I-I lost it all.

680
26:59.190 --> 27:00.080
Okay, look,

681
27:00.080 --> 27:01.040
I'll go talk to

682
27:01.040 --> 27:02.150
Qi Mo.

683
27:02.280 --> 27:03.720
He'll definitely give you

684
27:03.720 --> 27:04.520
a year or more.

685
27:04.560 --> 27:05.430
Once this project is done,

686
27:05.430 --> 27:06.280
and the company has money,

687
27:06.280 --> 27:07.350
I'll help you solve it.

688
27:07.350 --> 27:08.670
I'm calling him now.

689
27:08.760 --> 27:09.480
Shan, Shan.

690
27:09.480 --> 27:10.110
No.

691
27:10.110 --> 27:11.840
Don't call him. Don't call him.

692
27:13.240 --> 27:14.520
Just tell me,

693
27:14.820 --> 27:17.080
can you sell it for 3 million yuan or not?

694
27:17.520 --> 27:18.320
I can.

695
27:18.860 --> 27:19.720
I'm the chairman,

696
27:19.720 --> 27:20.870
and I definitely want to help you.

697
27:20.870 --> 27:22.240
That's my godson.

698
27:23.670 --> 27:25.110
But I also have to ask

699
27:25.110 --> 27:26.560
the board of directors.

700
27:26.560 --> 27:27.520
No need.

701
27:27.520 --> 27:28.760
The members of the board

702
27:28.760 --> 27:29.960
are all shareholders.

703
27:29.960 --> 27:31.040
Do you think they

704
27:31.280 --> 27:32.480
will agree?

705
27:32.630 --> 27:33.480
Let me count for you.

706
27:33.480 --> 27:34.280
You know them.

707
27:34.590 --> 27:36.560
He Jianchuan, Sun Jie,

708
27:36.830 --> 27:37.590
those two from the hair salon...

709
27:37.590 --> 27:38.430
I know.

710
27:38.430 --> 27:39.630
I have an emergency.

711
27:39.630 --> 27:40.630
I have to go.

712
27:40.630 --> 27:41.630
I have to go.

713
27:48.280 --> 27:49.000
Xiaoyun.

714
27:50.720 --> 27:51.520
Godfather?

715
27:52.560 --> 27:53.690
You wanted to see me?

716
27:54.080 --> 27:54.870
Sit.

717
28:02.910 --> 28:03.630
Godfather.

718
28:06.000 --> 28:06.520
I know

719
28:06.520 --> 28:08.850
about the situation between you and Qi Mo,

720
28:09.240 --> 28:10.350
and I know that Qi Mo

721
28:10.350 --> 28:12.390
has been pushing you hard lately.

722
28:13.040 --> 28:14.500
Aren't you short of money?

723
28:15.390 --> 28:16.430
I have money.

724
28:17.000 --> 28:17.960
I can help you.

725
28:21.150 --> 28:21.910
Really?

726
28:23.590 --> 28:24.560
I was the one who found out about your embezzlement

727
28:24.560 --> 28:26.520
and told Qi Mo.

728
28:27.520 --> 28:28.430
I-I know.

729
28:29.830 --> 28:31.490
You wouldn't blame me, right?

730
28:32.110 --> 28:32.870
I'm an accountant.

731
28:32.870 --> 28:34.320
It's my duty.

732
28:36.760 --> 28:37.800
But there's one thing

733
28:37.800 --> 28:39.040
I didn't tell him.

734
28:41.350 --> 28:42.350
Why did you transfer the money

735
28:42.350 --> 28:43.590
to Liu Hong?

736
28:47.280 --> 28:48.520
She and Wan Yang

737
28:48.960 --> 28:51.020
gave you a really hard time back then.

738
28:51.110 --> 28:52.910
Why would you give her money?

739
28:55.660 --> 28:56.740
Well...

740
28:59.760 --> 29:00.910
I hated Wan Yang.

741
29:03.560 --> 29:05.240
But his wife Liu Hong

742
29:05.270 --> 29:06.930
always came to me to complain.

743
29:08.760 --> 29:10.190
I was too soft-hearted.

744
29:10.830 --> 29:12.480
Seeing them as a widow and orphan,

745
29:12.480 --> 29:13.800
I felt really sorry for them.

746
29:13.800 --> 29:15.460
It wasn't that simple, was it?

747
29:17.320 --> 29:17.800
Godfather,

748
29:17.800 --> 29:19.530
I really want to give you money,

749
29:20.710 --> 29:22.680
but you have to tell me the truth.

750
29:23.080 --> 29:24.080
If I don't know the reason,

751
29:24.080 --> 29:25.080
how can I help you?

752
29:30.240 --> 29:31.040
One day,

753
29:31.590 --> 29:32.830
Liu Hong came to me,

754
29:32.830 --> 29:33.480
saying

755
29:33.480 --> 29:35.410
her daughter was studying abroad,

756
29:35.630 --> 29:37.430
and she couldn't afford the tuition.

757
29:37.430 --> 29:38.630
I thought about it...

758
29:39.910 --> 29:41.000
Then I decided to give her money for 2 months...

759
29:41.000 --> 29:42.800
-2 months... -Not just 2 months.

760
29:44.320 --> 29:46.050
You give her money every month.

761
29:49.390 --> 29:50.150
Godfather.

762
29:52.350 --> 29:53.670
Did Liu Hong

763
29:54.560 --> 29:56.390
blackmail you with something?

764
30:02.630 --> 30:03.430
Yes.

765
30:04.630 --> 30:05.430
You know,

766
30:06.110 --> 30:08.350
I've never

767
30:08.390 --> 30:09.520
been married,

768
30:10.830 --> 30:12.360
and I get lonely sometimes.

769
30:15.350 --> 30:17.210
Once, I couldn't control myself,

770
30:17.390 --> 30:18.830
and she got a hold on me.

771
30:20.350 --> 30:22.280
Then I kept transferring money to her

772
30:22.280 --> 30:23.430
every month.

773
30:26.040 --> 30:27.840
One mistake ruined everything.

774
30:30.830 --> 30:33.110
I really regret it.

775
30:33.910 --> 30:35.770
My lifelong reputation is ruined

776
30:36.320 --> 30:37.430
because of her.

777
30:50.830 --> 30:52.090
I'm telling the truth.

778
30:53.350 --> 30:55.080
Since you won't tell the truth,

779
30:55.760 --> 30:56.760
I won't force you.

780
30:58.630 --> 30:59.630
As for the money,

781
31:01.150 --> 31:03.680
you'll have to find a way to solve it yourself.

782
31:04.150 --> 31:05.010
It's the truth.

783
31:05.480 --> 31:06.830
I'm telling the truth.

784
31:12.870 --> 31:13.480
I...

785
31:25.240 --> 31:26.440
Geng Jian won't talk.

786
31:27.080 --> 31:28.410
Let's stick to the plan.

787
31:44.960 --> 31:46.760
Sun Jie, what are you going to do?

788
31:47.080 --> 31:49.240
Wan was your benefactor!

789
31:49.240 --> 31:51.780
Whoever pays me is my benefactor.

790
31:52.120 --> 31:53.520
Geng Jian paid me 200,000 yuan

791
31:53.520 --> 31:54.980
to take your life.

792
32:00.320 --> 32:01.830
You're too greedy.

793
32:02.910 --> 32:03.870
He gives you 15,000 yuan a month.

794
32:03.870 --> 32:05.280
How can you still think it's not enough?

795
32:05.280 --> 32:07.240
You pushed him to a dead end.

796
32:08.150 --> 32:09.750
That's why he wants you dead.

797
32:10.670 --> 32:12.180
I won't let you off easy.

798
32:13.080 --> 32:14.010
Three years ago,

799
32:15.350 --> 32:16.800
you forged orders

800
32:16.910 --> 32:18.520
with your useless brother

801
32:18.520 --> 32:20.000
and got me into prison.

802
32:20.000 --> 32:21.390
I served 3 years in jail.

803
32:22.390 --> 32:23.390
So today,

804
32:23.430 --> 32:25.760
we'll settle old and new scores together.

805
32:26.240 --> 32:27.910
I won't go easy on you.

806
32:30.800 --> 32:33.190
The hotpot restaurant won't open tomorrow at noon.

807
32:33.190 --> 32:34.830
They'll come at 4:30 PM.

808
32:35.350 --> 32:36.240
I did the math.

809
32:36.350 --> 32:37.560
15 hours

810
32:38.870 --> 32:40.720
is enough to freeze you to death.

811
32:59.320 --> 33:00.850
Chen Shan, why are you here?

812
33:01.800 --> 33:02.760
Are you crazy?

813
33:02.820 --> 33:03.800
What are you doing, Chen Shan?

814
33:03.800 --> 33:04.560
What are you doing?

815
33:04.560 --> 33:05.330
Chen Shan!

816
33:05.910 --> 33:06.760
Jie.

817
33:08.190 --> 33:09.480
This is murder!

818
33:09.480 --> 33:10.240
I don't care!

819
33:10.760 --> 33:12.190
I know you hate Wan Yang.

820
33:12.280 --> 33:13.000
I hate him too.

821
33:13.000 --> 33:14.280
I wish I could kill him!

822
33:14.910 --> 33:16.350
You know how he treated

823
33:16.380 --> 33:17.580
my parents back then.

824
33:18.190 --> 33:19.480
But you can't do this.

825
33:20.110 --> 33:20.910
Jie.

826
33:21.280 --> 33:22.630
You just got out.

827
33:22.800 --> 33:24.000
Do you really want to

828
33:24.000 --> 33:25.350
go to jail again for this?

829
33:25.350 --> 33:26.520
I don't care.

830
33:27.150 --> 33:28.830
Geng Jian gave me money.

831
33:28.830 --> 33:29.760
Will you pay me

832
33:29.760 --> 33:30.590
to stop doing this?

833
33:30.590 --> 33:32.270
This isn't about money.

834
33:32.290 --> 33:32.910
Jie.

835
33:33.670 --> 33:34.530
Think about it.

836
33:35.000 --> 33:36.430
If you really kill her,

837
33:36.480 --> 33:37.460
you'll be doomed,

838
33:37.460 --> 33:38.860
and so will my godfather!

839
33:39.000 --> 33:40.390
Is Liu Hong

840
33:40.390 --> 33:41.190
really worth it?

841
33:41.190 --> 33:42.830
Who cares about a woman like her?

842
33:42.830 --> 33:44.190
Even her own brother doesn't care about her.

843
33:44.190 --> 33:45.000
If none of us tell anyone,

844
33:45.000 --> 33:45.800
who will know?

845
33:46.240 --> 33:47.000
Oh, right.

846
33:47.000 --> 33:48.460
She has a daughter abroad.

847
33:48.760 --> 33:50.560
If I get a chance to go abroad

848
33:50.560 --> 33:51.240
one day,

849
33:51.240 --> 33:51.830
I'll take

850
33:51.830 --> 33:52.830
her daughter's life too!

851
33:52.830 --> 33:54.240
I'll end it all!

852
33:56.760 --> 33:57.560
Fine.

853
33:57.760 --> 33:58.630
Do whatever you want!

854
33:58.630 --> 34:00.030
This is out of my control!

855
34:02.320 --> 34:03.320
But before that,

856
34:03.910 --> 34:04.630
can you let me

857
34:04.630 --> 34:05.960
ask her a few questions?

858
34:07.800 --> 34:08.630
I just want to talk,

859
34:08.630 --> 34:09.440
okay?

860
34:11.480 --> 34:13.230
Fine, hurry up!

861
34:16.190 --> 34:17.310
Save me! I'm begging you!

862
34:17.310 --> 34:17.960
Be quiet!

863
34:17.960 --> 34:19.820
I have money. I can give you money!

864
34:21.840 --> 34:23.230
Liu Jun already told me

865
34:23.920 --> 34:24.750
that you have

866
34:24.750 --> 34:26.190
something on my godfather,

867
34:26.190 --> 34:27.960
and it's related to my family.

868
34:31.310 --> 34:32.080
You can see

869
34:32.080 --> 34:33.139
the situation now.

870
34:33.750 --> 34:35.710
Tell me what you know,

871
34:37.000 --> 34:38.520
and maybe I can save you.

872
34:49.360 --> 34:50.260
Geng Jian...

873
34:50.840 --> 34:51.690
He...

874
34:52.590 --> 34:53.320
He killed...

875
34:56.630 --> 34:58.030
H-He killed your mother.

876
34:58.480 --> 34:59.740
He killed your mother!

877
35:01.920 --> 35:03.960
Before Wan Yang died, he recorded

878
35:03.960 --> 35:05.920
how Geng Jian killed your mother.

879
35:06.000 --> 35:08.300
It's evidence of your mother's murder.

880
35:08.330 --> 35:10.700
I-I have it.

881
35:14.840 --> 35:15.640
Director Wan,

882
35:16.880 --> 35:18.520
why did you want to see me?

883
35:19.710 --> 35:21.720
How does it feel to be the top leader?

884
35:21.770 --> 35:22.250
Come on.

885
35:23.790 --> 35:24.920
It's all for work.

886
35:26.360 --> 35:27.440
I smell cigars.

887
35:28.920 --> 35:29.920
I didn't smoke it.

888
35:30.310 --> 35:32.080
The smell was too strong. I couldn't stand it.

889
35:32.080 --> 35:33.080
I figured so.

890
35:34.150 --> 35:35.270
But you'll smoke

891
35:35.270 --> 35:36.800
a second puff, then a third,

892
35:37.840 --> 35:39.670
forcing yourself to like it.

893
35:39.670 --> 35:40.880
Then slowly,

894
35:40.880 --> 35:42.630
you'll get used to it.

895
35:43.710 --> 35:44.680
D-Did you call me here

896
35:44.680 --> 35:45.960
just for this?

897
35:46.440 --> 35:48.170
I want you to see this teahouse.

898
35:49.110 --> 35:51.060
Every day at 5:15 PM,

899
35:51.360 --> 35:53.750
it's the best time to watch the sunset.

900
35:54.920 --> 35:56.520
Mr. Zhao at the teahouse

901
35:56.520 --> 35:57.880
can make

902
35:58.150 --> 35:59.750
the best tea.

903
36:00.560 --> 36:02.510
I already brewed

904
36:03.560 --> 36:04.400
some tea for you just now

905
36:04.400 --> 36:06.270
with that antique purple clay teapot.

906
36:06.270 --> 36:07.480
You can try it later.

907
36:08.150 --> 36:09.790
Every year when the new tea arrives,

908
36:09.790 --> 36:11.040
as long as you're here,

909
36:11.040 --> 36:12.670
I'll let you smell it

910
36:13.560 --> 36:15.690
so you can remember the taste of power.

911
36:17.840 --> 36:19.400
Well, I think that

912
36:19.960 --> 36:20.920
power is meant

913
36:20.920 --> 36:23.050
to benefit all the workers in the plant

914
36:23.360 --> 36:25.560
instead of making profits for oneself.

915
36:25.920 --> 36:27.110
Those old and corrupt things

916
36:27.110 --> 36:27.920
are outdated.

917
36:28.920 --> 36:29.750
Director Wan,

918
36:30.080 --> 36:31.230
I won't drink here.

919
36:31.230 --> 36:32.290
Drink it yourself.

920
36:32.630 --> 36:33.440
I'm leaving.

921
36:34.360 --> 36:35.920
"I'd rather give up the empire

922
36:35.920 --> 36:37.360
for a beauty."

923
36:38.840 --> 36:40.300
You said that, didn't you?

924
36:50.230 --> 36:51.080
Don't use that nonsense

925
36:51.080 --> 36:52.440
to threaten me anymore.

926
36:52.520 --> 36:53.520
We are different.

927
36:54.000 --> 36:55.360
I can change.

928
36:55.360 --> 36:56.110
I'll lead all the workers in the plant

929
36:56.110 --> 36:57.440
towards a bright path

930
36:57.970 --> 36:59.830
and eliminate unhealthy trends!

931
37:00.840 --> 37:02.230
Well, this is the funniest joke

932
37:02.230 --> 37:04.440
I've ever heard.

933
37:05.560 --> 37:06.480
Geng Jian,

934
37:06.520 --> 37:08.040
you've been acting so long

935
37:08.040 --> 37:09.080
that you're used to it

936
37:09.080 --> 37:10.840
and even believe it yourself.

937
37:12.470 --> 37:14.400
Isn't it funny

938
37:15.040 --> 37:16.480
for a murderer

939
37:17.400 --> 37:18.670
to say this nonsense?

940
37:30.000 --> 37:32.040
Yes, that look.

941
37:33.000 --> 37:34.040
Back when you were arrested for prostitution

942
37:34.040 --> 37:35.570
and asked me to bail you out,

943
37:37.360 --> 37:38.560
you had the same look.

944
37:39.230 --> 37:40.150
That day, right after

945
37:40.150 --> 37:42.150
I asked you to talk to Zhang Wenying,

946
37:42.270 --> 37:43.790
she died.

947
37:44.670 --> 37:46.270
Is there such a coincidence?

948
37:46.790 --> 37:48.390
I didn't even go to her place.

949
37:49.480 --> 37:50.750
I didn't agree to go.

950
37:54.310 --> 37:55.960
You forced her to her death!

951
37:58.360 --> 37:59.270
To be honest,

952
38:00.190 --> 38:02.450
when I asked you to talk to Zhang Wenying,

953
38:03.190 --> 38:04.560
I was worried.

954
38:05.750 --> 38:07.150
So, I stayed downstairs.

955
38:07.230 --> 38:09.040
You went upstairs at 8:40 PM,

956
38:09.080 --> 38:10.340
stayed for 15 minutes,

957
38:10.360 --> 38:12.080
and came down in a panic.

958
38:12.270 --> 38:14.400
Then you hurriedly ran back up again.

959
38:14.550 --> 38:17.060
[Staff Certificate]

960
38:15.370 --> 38:16.760
You dropped something.

961
38:22.620 --> 38:23.260
[Staff Certificate]

962
38:24.270 --> 38:26.060
[Staff Certificate]

963
38:29.000 --> 38:29.750
I didn't go.

964
38:33.080 --> 38:34.400
Deny it as you want.

965
38:35.230 --> 38:36.920
Let's go to the police station.

966
38:36.920 --> 38:38.080
They are the experts.

967
38:38.080 --> 38:39.750
We'll let them analyze it.

968
38:40.040 --> 38:41.590
I made a lot of mistakes.

969
38:41.710 --> 38:43.440
I might be sentenced to 7 or 9 years

970
38:43.440 --> 38:44.590
in prison.

971
38:44.840 --> 38:46.000
But murder

972
38:46.630 --> 38:48.030
means the death penalty.

973
38:48.710 --> 38:49.520
Let's go.

974
38:49.710 --> 38:51.280
W-What are you doing?

975
38:51.860 --> 38:52.710
Scared?

976
38:55.400 --> 38:56.120
Let's go.

977
38:57.840 --> 38:58.920
What do you want?

978
38:59.230 --> 39:00.190
Tell me,

979
39:01.080 --> 39:02.790
did you kill her?

980
39:11.840 --> 39:12.440
No.

981
39:14.520 --> 39:15.790
Really?

982
39:19.230 --> 39:20.080
No.

983
39:22.590 --> 39:23.400
You...

984
39:27.000 --> 39:28.310
Didn't you ask me

985
39:28.670 --> 39:29.840
to talk to her?

986
39:29.840 --> 39:30.590
Senior.

987
39:31.080 --> 39:32.110
Could you please

988
39:33.080 --> 39:34.400
calm down?

989
39:35.670 --> 39:36.840
Don't turn yourself in.

990
39:36.840 --> 39:38.670
I told her, "Don't turn yourself in.

991
39:38.670 --> 39:40.600
That wouldn't be good for anyone."

992
39:41.790 --> 39:42.790
Then she got mad.

993
39:42.790 --> 39:44.440
She was furious.

994
39:44.440 --> 39:45.980
You're such a coward!

995
39:46.040 --> 39:47.590
She called me a coward.

996
39:47.630 --> 39:49.540
She scolded me.

997
39:49.570 --> 39:51.130
So timid.

998
39:51.360 --> 39:53.610
You'll always be a loser.

999
39:53.630 --> 39:54.670
She said, "You're like a eunuch"...

1000
39:54.670 --> 39:55.560
You're like a eunuch,

1001
39:55.560 --> 39:56.360
always serving others!

1002
39:56.360 --> 39:57.630
"Always serving others.

1003
39:57.630 --> 39:59.040
You'll always be a loser."

1004
39:59.040 --> 39:59.710
You'll never be

1005
39:59.710 --> 40:00.960
the plant director!

1006
40:00.960 --> 40:02.080
"You'll never be the boss!"

1007
40:02.080 --> 40:03.710
I've never looked up to you!

1008
40:03.710 --> 40:05.310
You make me sick!

1009
40:05.310 --> 40:06.050
She insulted me...

1010
40:06.050 --> 40:07.440
Go! Go!

1011
40:07.840 --> 40:09.520
Then I took a rope

1012
40:09.520 --> 40:11.520
and... put it around her neck.

1013
40:11.520 --> 40:12.000
I...

1014
40:12.760 --> 40:14.710
I treated your family so well,

1015
40:14.710 --> 40:16.190
and all I get is this

1016
40:16.210 --> 40:17.230
"eunuch"!

1017
40:17.360 --> 40:18.360
No respect,

1018
40:18.360 --> 40:20.230
no value at all?

1019
40:20.260 --> 40:22.360
Why is everyone humiliating me?

1020
40:22.360 --> 40:23.480
No respect!

1021
40:23.480 --> 40:25.190
You must apologize!

1022
40:25.840 --> 40:28.080
Apologize! Apologize!

1023
40:29.670 --> 40:31.480
"Apologize to me..."

1024
40:32.880 --> 40:34.480
You used too much strength

1025
40:35.920 --> 40:37.450
and strangled her to death.

1026
40:55.520 --> 40:57.490
What do you want?

1027
41:00.000 --> 41:00.790
Geng Jian.

1028
41:02.270 --> 41:03.880
I want to ask you for a favor.

1029
41:04.840 --> 41:06.770
If something really happens to me,

1030
41:06.960 --> 41:07.710
can you take good care of

1031
